HST Office: Sheets' ribbon groups sit where Writer's do, so their captions share the other apps' row.

Gap list G06: with one ribbon height (hst-ribbon-equal-height.patch) Sheets' group captions sat 3–4 px below
Writer's, Slides' and Draw's (y 145 against 141–142 at 1485 px, Linux): its tab boxes were vertically centred and
filled the page 2 px higher and lower than Writer's. They fill the height now, with Writer's 2 px above and below.

